[{"start":23368.582,"end":23369.762,"text":"Please introduce yourself."},{"start":23369.962,"end":23370.802,"text":"Okay. Hello."},{"start":23372.122,"end":23374.982,"text":"Hello, everyone, and good afternoon."},{"start":23375.022,"end":23378.042,"text":"My name is Shih-Hsen Li. I'm from"},{"start":23378.462,"end":23382.142,"text":"Biodiversity Research Museum and Biodiversity"},{"start":23382.202,"end":23385.942,"text":"Research Center, Academia Sinica, Taiwan, and also"},{"start":23385.982,"end":23388.282,"text":"Taipei. Yeah, such a long name."},{"start":23391.022,"end":23394.962,"text":"And my topic is Closing Gap in Specimen Metadata."},{"start":23395.442,"end":23396.922,"text":"Yeah, and because"},{"start":23398.422,"end":23400.302,"text":"myself, I'm working on a"},{"start":23401.502,"end":23404.722,"text":"natural history collection management system for our"},{"start":23404.802,"end":23408.522,"text":"institution, and that is a platform"},{"start":23408.582,"end":23412.402,"text":"that any other different institution can"},{"start":23412.522,"end":23416.442,"text":"use the same platform. And then we find some problem,"},{"start":23416.622,"end":23420.182,"text":"I will explain later. And"},{"start":23420.502,"end":23421.542,"text":"that is the,"},{"start":23423.062,"end":23423.202,"text":"oh,"},{"start":23424.802,"end":23428.182,"text":"that's a GBIF data trend. You can find"},{"start":23428.942,"end":23429.122,"text":"that"},{"start":23430.062,"end":23432.442,"text":"graph in GBIF's data trend."},{"start":23435.762,"end":23439.222,"text":"That is captured from GBIF data trend page, and"},{"start":23439.942,"end":23443.562,"text":"it has some explain about the data completeness."},{"start":23444.222,"end":23447.322,"text":"Yeah. I think you maybe know the data completeness,"},{"start":23447.762,"end":23449.522,"text":"maybe including the"},{"start":23450.662,"end":23451.722,"text":"metadata that"},{"start":23453.342,"end":23455.182,"text":"didn't have the full date"},{"start":23456.622,"end":23460.522,"text":"of the specimen's collection date, and"},{"start":23460.562,"end":23464.222,"text":"they don't have the identification for the"},{"start":23464.362,"end":23468.282,"text":"species rank, or they don't have the valid"},{"start":23468.342,"end":23472.322,"text":"coordinate, or even the locality in the"},{"start":23472.421,"end":23474.202,"text":"Biden text. And that's"},{"start":23475.182,"end":23476.962,"text":"about the data completeness."},{"start":23478.902,"end":23480.522,"text":"And we can see that that's"},{"start":23482.242,"end":23485.722,"text":"is also from GBIF data trend page."},{"start":23486.382,"end":23489.642,"text":"It's a global scope. And the left"},{"start":23491.282,"end":23492.662,"text":"side is the"},{"start":23493.662,"end":23497.322,"text":"observation records, like data, most of"},{"start":23497.382,"end":23501.042,"text":"data from eBird or iNaturalist. And"},{"start":23501.122,"end":23502.922,"text":"the right one is the"},{"start":23504.042,"end":23505.342,"text":"specimen data. Yeah,"},{"start":23506.322,"end":23507.722,"text":"in GBIF, the"},{"start":23508.802,"end":23512.362,"text":"basis of record is a preserved specimen, or fossil"},{"start":23512.482,"end":23516.362,"text":"specimen, or living specimen. And we can see that the"},{"start":23516.702,"end":23518.342,"text":"specimen data, the"},{"start":23519.262,"end":23519.922,"text":"yellow color"},{"start":23521.262,"end":23521.622,"text":"means"},{"start":23521.702,"end":23527.062,"text":"that"},{"start":23527.342,"end":23528.202,"text":"the data from"},{"start":23529.182,"end":23533.122,"text":"observation data and specimen data also"},{"start":23533.642,"end":23535.382,"text":"increased this year"},{"start":23536.222,"end":23539.862,"text":"very much. But the specimen data lack"},{"start":23539.982,"end":23543.722,"text":"of completeness, and that gap is getting"},{"start":23544.222,"end":23547.742,"text":"larger and larger. So that's a problem, and we want"},{"start":23547.822,"end":23551.042,"text":"to try to fix that."},{"start":23553.202,"end":23556.822,"text":"And because I'm from Taiwan, so I found the"},{"start":23557.582,"end":23560.242,"text":"data trend from Taiwan also, and that"},{"start":23561.142,"end":23563.102,"text":"it's like the same, so maybe it's"},{"start":23564.762,"end":23565.722,"text":"everybody has the"},{"start":23566.662,"end":23567.942,"text":"issues. And"},{"start":23569.382,"end":23570.842,"text":"why cause that? Because the"},{"start":23572.842,"end":23576.662,"text":"take image is very fast. You only need seconds"},{"start":23576.722,"end":23580.602,"text":"to take a image or even use a scanner, maybe"},{"start":23581.63,"end":23581.99,"text":"Maybe"},{"start":23582.87,"end":23586.67,"text":"one or two minutes can down. And everyone can do that, they just"},{"start":23586.73,"end":23589.79,"text":"press the button and no need"},{"start":23590.89,"end":23591.25,"text":"train"},{"start":23592.67,"end":23594.65,"text":"human to do that. And"},{"start":23595.65,"end":23597.89,"text":"it's easy to buy an equipment,"},{"start":23598.73,"end":23600.87,"text":"scanner or camera. And"},{"start":23601.85,"end":23602.07,"text":"the"},{"start":23605.43,"end":23609.01,"text":"image are stored in hard drives. But about the"},{"start":23609.07,"end":23612.37,"text":"transcription, it's very slow, take time,"},{"start":23612.97,"end":23616.45,"text":"and needs expert to read the old handwriting."},{"start":23616.75,"end":23619.91,"text":"Also in Taiwan, we have some different era,"},{"start":23620.43,"end":23620.77,"text":"some"},{"start":23622.11,"end":23625.77,"text":"Western exploration era and Japanese era."},{"start":23625.85,"end":23627.83,"text":"So different,"},{"start":23631.91,"end":23633.81,"text":"also have some handwriting or"},{"start":23634.83,"end":23637.83,"text":"different type of specimen label."},{"start":23637.89,"end":23639.77,"text":"It's really hard to read if"},{"start":23640.99,"end":23644.17,"text":"the transcriber not well-trained."},{"start":23646.03,"end":23647.25,"text":"And the transcriber,"},{"start":23650.57,"end":23654.31,"text":"we have to another fund for them to do"},{"start":23654.37,"end":23654.73,"text":"that."},{"start":23657.09,"end":23660.45,"text":"But after transcribe, the data, have"},{"start":23660.49,"end":23664.27,"text":"metadata you can be searched for and useful in public data."},{"start":23664.35,"end":23667.51,"text":"It's easy to find. But it's a"},{"start":23670.35,"end":23671.01,"text":"bottleneck."},{"start":23672.81,"end":23673.01,"text":"But,"},{"start":23674.43,"end":23677.37,"text":"it started from maybe three"},{"start":23677.41,"end":23679.63,"text":"years ago, and"},{"start":23680.61,"end":23680.95,"text":"we have"},{"start":23682.75,"end":23685.17,"text":"nature history collection management system."},{"start":23685.69,"end":23685.99,"text":"And"},{"start":23687.33,"end":23689.17,"text":"we also help other"},{"start":23690.33,"end":23692.67,"text":"institution in Taiwan. They"},{"start":23695.55,"end":23699.35,"text":"don't have enough money to set up a database or"},{"start":23699.63,"end":23701.65,"text":"do the digitization for their own."},{"start":23702.17,"end":23703.61,"text":"So we just,"},{"start":23704.67,"end":23708.51,"text":"in our institution, we have some cooperation,"},{"start":23709.03,"end":23712.77,"text":"and we provide the system for them to"},{"start":23712.87,"end":23716.61,"text":"upload their data, and they"},{"start":23716.67,"end":23719.51,"text":"assign some people to do the digitization."},{"start":23720.33,"end":23723.53,"text":"But no one to transcribe the data, so the data still"},{"start":23723.95,"end":23724.73,"text":"hidden in"},{"start":23727.95,"end":23731.41,"text":"the hard disk or even in the cloud because it has no"},{"start":23731.97,"end":23735.53,"text":"metadata. We just can see a lot of pictures, but"},{"start":23735.63,"end":23738.15,"text":"it's hard to find."},{"start":23739.03,"end":23739.43,"text":"And so,"},{"start":23742.93,"end":23743.11,"text":"we"},{"start":23743.93,"end":23744.13,"text":"let"},{"start":23745.67,"end":23747.11,"text":"the institutions'"},{"start":23748.17,"end":23751.15,"text":"teacher, the college teacher, they"},{"start":23751.89,"end":23755.87,"text":"ask their student in the class to do the transcription."},{"start":23756.33,"end":23756.67,"text":"And"},{"start":23758.53,"end":23758.89,"text":"that's"},{"start":23760.39,"end":23761.95,"text":"unpaid free labor."},{"start":23763.81,"end":23767.77,"text":"So they can do this, and the teacher can give the grade and"},{"start":23769.83,"end":23773.47,"text":"assign every student a homework, like hundreds of"},{"start":23775.39,"end":23777.37,"text":"specimen data they have to transcribe."},{"start":23777.71,"end":23780.29,"text":"But that's maybe two or three years."},{"start":23780.63,"end":23782.71,"text":"And then we use AI to"},{"start":23784.55,"end":23788.31,"text":"quickly do this. And then we find that that's"},{"start":23788.39,"end":23791.53,"text":"only solve the problem of only one"},{"start":23791.59,"end":23795.15,"text":"institution, and the pace is still very slow."},{"start":23797.01,"end":23800.99,"text":"So we try to, in Taiwan, we have another"},{"start":23803.83,"end":23806.93,"text":"organization called TBIA, Taiwan"},{"start":23807.03,"end":23809.53,"text":"Biodiversity Information Alliance."},{"start":23809.87,"end":23810.39,"text":"And that's,"},{"start":23811.79,"end":23811.87,"text":"we"},{"start":23813.25,"end":23816.35,"text":"combine many institution or government"},{"start":23816.77,"end":23820.21,"text":"organization in Taiwan. They have biodiversity"},{"start":23820.35,"end":23823.77,"text":"data, and we collect the data together and make a"},{"start":23823.85,"end":23826.11,"text":"aggregated portal and"},{"start":23827.05,"end":23830.79,"text":"website. And that data also publish"},{"start":23830.85,"end":23832.99,"text":"in GBIF. So that's just"},{"start":23835.77,"end":23837.97,"text":"national well-aggregated data."},{"start":23838.889,"end":23839.75,"text":"So I"},{"start":23843.91,"end":23846.69,"text":"try to make a system that this"},{"start":23847.49,"end":23850.93,"text":"use AI for help transcription can"},{"start":23851.49,"end":23855.17,"text":"apply to all the specimen in the TBIA system."},{"start":23855.73,"end":23857.35,"text":"And that everybody can"},{"start":23858.55,"end":23859.63,"text":"help transcribe"},{"start":23861.21,"end":23864.99,"text":"via the system. And the transcription, the annotation will"},{"start":23865.09,"end":23868.93,"text":"keep in the system and help the data provider to..."},{"start":23872.09,"end":23875.53,"text":"They can quickly closing the gap of the"},{"start":23876.33,"end":23879.63,"text":"missing metadata. And the specimen in"},{"start":23880.29,"end":23880.75,"text":"TBIA,"},{"start":23883.05,"end":23884.05,"text":"the natural history"},{"start":23885.01,"end":23888.81,"text":"data is about 2 million data. And the"},{"start":23888.87,"end":23890.85,"text":"data says it's across"},{"start":23892.33,"end":23893.87,"text":"Taiwan institution and"},{"start":23895.81,"end":23898.97,"text":"worldwide museum. That's from GBIF data."},{"start":23902.35,"end":23902.79,"text":"Yes. And"},{"start":23904.95,"end":23908.63,"text":"thanks for TBIA has made a good"},{"start":23908.73,"end":23911.73,"text":"aggregate of the data, so I can quickly find that."},{"start":23912.65,"end":23912.89,"text":"That's"},{"start":23913.85,"end":23915.87,"text":"different flake of the data, like"},{"start":23917.31,"end":23920.69,"text":"30% of the data are missing identification."},{"start":23921.13,"end":23923.23,"text":"But it's not real missing because,"},{"start":23924.57,"end":23925.45,"text":"when some data"},{"start":23926.87,"end":23929.13,"text":"provider, they publish to some"},{"start":23932.65,"end":23936.31,"text":"organization portal and then go to the TBIA, and"},{"start":23936.53,"end":23936.79,"text":"each"},{"start":23937.67,"end":23938.79,"text":"step maybe, the"},{"start":23940.41,"end":23943.73,"text":"mapping scientific name maybe a little change."},{"start":23944.11,"end":23944.87,"text":"And so that"},{"start":23945.71,"end":23946.53,"text":"will cause the-"},{"start":23948.486,"end":23950.366,"text":"Scientific name matching problem."},{"start":23950.426,"end":23950.546,"text":"And"},{"start":23952.926,"end":23955.126,"text":"all of the data will match"},{"start":23956.546,"end":23958.146,"text":"by the TAICo. It's"},{"start":23958.986,"end":23959.866,"text":"like catalog"},{"start":23960.926,"end":23963.966,"text":"of Taiwan, and it's a national"},{"start":23965.386,"end":23966.786,"text":"species checklist. And"},{"start":23968.686,"end":23971.626,"text":"TBIA already mapped the specimen"},{"start":23972.326,"end":23975.466,"text":"scientific name to the TAICo, so it's linked."},{"start":23976.086,"end":23979.946,"text":"And then the missing coordinate data"},{"start":23980.026,"end":23982.226,"text":"has many, above"},{"start":23982.986,"end":23986.746,"text":"65%. But most of that,"},{"start":23987.046,"end":23991.006,"text":"it still have some locality information. Yeah."},{"start":23992.446,"end":23995.766,"text":"So, we still can find the coordinate because"},{"start":23996.546,"end":23999.946,"text":"it's in verbatim locality. So, we"},{"start":23999.986,"end":24002.206,"text":"have some"},{"start":24003.526,"end":24004.626,"text":"clue to find that."},{"start":24006.606,"end":24010.306,"text":"But the most problem is missing media data, because if"},{"start":24010.406,"end":24013.486,"text":"you don't have the picture, you cannot do"},{"start":24014.486,"end":24018.006,"text":"a transcription things. And now, this is the"},{"start":24018.086,"end":24018.586,"text":"system"},{"start":24019.846,"end":24023.166,"text":"looks like. And you can explore the"},{"start":24024.026,"end":24026.186,"text":"data in the TBIA. And"},{"start":24027.006,"end":24028.666,"text":"then you can see that some"},{"start":24030.866,"end":24032.666,"text":"terms are missing. So,"},{"start":24034.246,"end":24038.006,"text":"the right side is you can see the specimen and"},{"start":24038.086,"end":24039.846,"text":"try to help them"},{"start":24040.766,"end":24043.766,"text":"fill the missing terms. And you"},{"start":24043.806,"end":24047.686,"text":"can just use your eyes to do that, and"},{"start":24047.746,"end":24051.106,"text":"you can use AI. We have integrated the"},{"start":24051.746,"end":24054.086,"text":"AI API that can transcribe and..."},{"start":24056.646,"end":24060.526,"text":"Yeah. And transcribe, and you can choose, because the AI maybe"},{"start":24060.586,"end":24064.166,"text":"has wrong, especially the local name"},{"start":24064.766,"end":24067.406,"text":"in which in Chinese. Yeah. The"},{"start":24068.466,"end":24070.466,"text":"handwriting English, I think AI is"},{"start":24071.406,"end":24073.726,"text":"very good at it. But in Chinese,"},{"start":24075.786,"end":24077.146,"text":"or Japanese,"},{"start":24079.966,"end":24080.506,"text":"I think it's"},{"start":24081.326,"end":24084.886,"text":"hard for AI to do that. And so a human"},{"start":24084.926,"end":24085.686,"text":"needs to"},{"start":24087.066,"end":24087.526,"text":"do some"},{"start":24088.686,"end":24092.406,"text":"correction on that. And the system will save the"},{"start":24092.466,"end":24093.046,"text":"data that"},{"start":24094.346,"end":24097.746,"text":"the AI transcribed, or human correction."},{"start":24098.146,"end":24101.866,"text":"And later, we can analyze that AI's doing"},{"start":24101.926,"end":24102.546,"text":"good or"},{"start":24104.666,"end":24107.186,"text":"not good. We can analyze later."},{"start":24108.626,"end":24110.166,"text":"And then we have doing"},{"start":24110.246,"end":24114.046,"text":"some data"},{"start":24114.766,"end":24116.646,"text":"analysis, and we have"},{"start":24119.926,"end":24121.946,"text":"make the collectors"},{"start":24123.126,"end":24124.406,"text":"and identifier."},{"start":24130.306,"end":24132.386,"text":"I've made some story about the..."},{"start":24133.626,"end":24135.646,"text":"You can find a collector and"},{"start":24136.746,"end":24139.946,"text":"his collection trip in a map and"},{"start":24140.726,"end":24144.666,"text":"by ear. And you can find that some data,"},{"start":24145.846,"end":24146.846,"text":"when the data list"},{"start":24148.206,"end":24150.806,"text":"on the table, and you can just quickly see that"},{"start":24153.126,"end":24156.566,"text":"maybe some data is missing locality or missing date,"},{"start":24157.026,"end":24159.146,"text":"and when this data is"},{"start":24160.446,"end":24162.446,"text":"put together, grouped by the"},{"start":24164.206,"end":24166.566,"text":"collector. Yes. And that's also,"},{"start":24167.926,"end":24171.846,"text":"I try to make some old"},{"start":24171.886,"end":24174.246,"text":"literature from Taiwanese"},{"start":24175.306,"end":24178.986,"text":"botanical survey history, and it can be linked to"},{"start":24179.326,"end":24182.726,"text":"some data existing in the TBIA now."},{"start":24186.286,"end":24188.546,"text":"Yeah. And that's the other story."},{"start":24189.546,"end":24192.306,"text":"And that's the future work I want,"},{"start":24193.626,"end":24197.286,"text":"data provider through this system, and they"},{"start":24197.606,"end":24201.566,"text":"get the acceptable data. And"},{"start":24202.206,"end":24205.665,"text":"that correction data will go back to the data provider."},{"start":24205.966,"end":24207.225,"text":"They can decide,"},{"start":24208.526,"end":24212.346,"text":"and they can quickly update"},{"start":24212.406,"end":24214.346,"text":"their data and publish again. And"},{"start":24216.546,"end":24220.386,"text":"we wish to make the data more, the quality is more better."},{"start":24223.726,"end":24227.286,"text":"And we also want to try to use that"},{"start":24227.366,"end":24228.206,"text":"system to"},{"start":24229.446,"end":24232.806,"text":"let other institution in Taiwan that had not"},{"start":24232.866,"end":24236.526,"text":"digitized their specimen, and"},{"start":24237.546,"end":24241.506,"text":"want to say that an untranscribed image is not a"},{"start":24241.586,"end":24245.286,"text":"failure, it's an invitation. Because"},{"start":24246.346,"end":24246.826,"text":"Taiwanese"},{"start":24247.766,"end":24251.586,"text":"organization, maybe they feel like if they"},{"start":24251.986,"end":24254.546,"text":"publish, that data is incomplete, they will"},{"start":24258.326,"end":24258.746,"text":"feel"},{"start":24260.066,"end":24262.086,"text":"they have failure or they are not..."},{"start":24262.326,"end":24264.746,"text":"But it will stop the..."},{"start":24266.086,"end":24269.146,"text":"Everybody cannot find that data. And"},{"start":24269.226,"end":24273.166,"text":"so, yes, the system wants to do that."},{"start":24273.226,"end":24273.486,"text":"And"},{"start":24274.526,"end":24275.926,"text":"thanks for everybody."},{"start":24283.746,"end":24285.246,"text":"So, Lee Tzu-chen."},{"start":24285.306,"end":24285.626,"text":"Yeah."},{"start":24285.686,"end":24285.926,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":24286.846,"end":24287.566,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":24287.746,"end":24291.686,"text":"Okay. That's not so easy. I want to reassure everyone, if"},{"start":24291.746,"end":24295.326,"text":"you're intrigued as I was by his challenges, to give us"},{"start":24296.326,"end":24299.846,"text":"exciting bits to think about how to facilitate language,"},{"start":24301.146,"end":24302.466,"text":"things like in Binomia-"},{"start":24302.846,"end":24302.926,"text":"Yeah."},{"start":24302.926,"end":24305.786,"text":"... and being able to do what you envision there."},{"start":24305.866,"end":24306.126,"text":"Yes."},{"start":24306.186,"end":24307.986,"text":"And add that for your community."},{"start":24308.046,"end":24308.306,"text":"Yes."},{"start":24309.006,"end":24309.946,"text":"That's really exciting."},{"start":24310.206,"end":24310.366,"text":"Yes."},{"start":24310.446,"end":24310.826,"text":"Yes, and-"},{"start":24311.226,"end":24312.666,"text":"I'm trying to do"},{"start":24314.046,"end":24314.466,"text":"Yeah, there you go."},{"start":24314.606,"end":24314.826,"text":"Yeah."},{"start":24317.026,"end":24320.486,"text":"When I doing this project, I was thinking, I want"},{"start":24321.046,"end":24324.706,"text":"to let the collector's name sync with"},{"start":24324.766,"end":24328.706,"text":"Binomia and Wikidata, and that's what make the data easier"},{"start":24328.786,"end":24328.966,"text":"to-"},{"start":24330.018,"end":24333.878,"text":"Let people know that we have some collection or specimen"},{"start":24333.978,"end":24334.338,"text":"here."},{"start":24334.798,"end":24335.058,"text":"Yeah."},{"start":24335.338,"end":24335.358,"text":"Yeah."},{"start":24335.398,"end":24338.458,"text":"So thank you for that. And to all of you who find this intriguing,"},{"start":24338.898,"end":24342.378,"text":"online, the recording is fine, and the slides are there,"},{"start":24342.778,"end":24346.758,"text":"so you don't lose the story that Li Hu Xin, I have to say"},{"start":24346.798,"end":24346.918,"text":"it."},{"start":24346.978,"end":24347.158,"text":"Yeah."},{"start":24347.538,"end":24348.238,"text":"Xu Xin."},{"start":24348.278,"end":24349.078,"text":"Yeah. Perfect."},{"start":24349.118,"end":24349.618,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":24350.658,"end":24352.118,"text":"Was telling us. So thank you for that."}]